---
layout: base
title: Graphic design
description: "Illustration, stickers and book design by Ralph Hawkins, a service designer who also studied graphic design."
permalink: /graphic-design/
---

<h1 class="visually-hidden">Graphic design</h1>
<div class="gallery">
  {% for item in collections.gallery %}
    <article class="gallery-item">
      <h2>{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
      {#- The item's body is rendered markdown, i.e. its own <p>s — so the
         date gets a sibling paragraph, never a wrapping one. -#}
      <div>
        <p>{{ item.date | dateFormat }}</p>
        {% if item.content %}{{ item.content | safe }}{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if item.data.images %}
        <div class="gallery-images {% if item.data.images.length > 1 %}gallery-images-group{% endif %}">
          {% for image in item.data.images %}
            {% set _dim = image | imageSize %}
            <img
              src="{{ image }}"
              alt="{{ item.data.alt or item.data.title }}"
              class="gallery-image"
              loading="lazy"{% if _dim %}
              width="{{ _dim.width }}"
              height="{{ _dim.height }}"{% endif %}
            >
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
